window.docContents[233].resolve({"/Lean-Code/#A-Textbook--Lean-Code":{"contents":"The tools in this section come from the Verso namespace Verso.Genre.Manual.InlineLean.\n\nThe lean code block allows Lean code to be included in the text.\nIt is elaborated in the context of the text's elaboration.\n\ninductive NatList where\n  | nil\n  | cons : Nat → NatList → NatList\n\n\nUse the leanSection directive to create a Lean section that delimits scope changes.\nThe lean role allows Lean terms to be included as inline elements in paragraphs.\nUse name to refer to a name that can't be easily elaborated as a term, e.g. due to implicit parameters or type classes.\n\n\n\n","context":"A Textbook","header":"1. Lean Code","id":"/Lean-Code/#A-Textbook--Lean-Code"}});